## 5. Component Writing Standards

### One component = one file = one responsibility

```tsx
interface SessionCardProps {
  name: string
  phase: string
  updatedAt: string
  onClick: () => void
}

export function SessionCard({ name, phase, updatedAt, onClick }: SessionCardProps) {
  return (
    <button
      onClick={onClick}
      className="w-full p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 hover:border-primary transition-colors"
    >
      <span className="text-sm font-semibold">{name}</span>
    </button>
  )
}
```

### Props
- Always `interface XxxProps {}` — never inline `{ prop: type }` or `type Props = {}`
- Never `any`
- More than 6 props → split the component or use composition

### Conditional classes — always `cn()`

```tsx
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils/cn'

<div className={cn('base-class', isActive && 'bg-primary', isDisabled && 'opacity-50')} />
```

Never string-concatenate class names.

---

## 6. Styling Anti-Patterns Cheatsheet

| ❌ Do NOT | ✅ Do instead |
|-----------|--------------|
| `style={{ color: '#10b981' }}` | `className="text-primary"` |
| `className="text-[13px]"` | `className="text-sm"` |
| `className="p-[13px]"` | `className="p-3"` or `p-4` |
| `className="bg-[#F7F7F7]"` | `className="bg-gray-50"` |
| `className="rounded-[6px]"` | `className="rounded-md"` |
| Inline `<svg>` in JSX | Import from `lucide-react` or `assets/icons/` |
| CSS/div-drawn icon shape | Import the icon |
| New token for an existing value | Reuse the existing token |
| `import X from '../../..'` | `import X from '@/...'` |
| Fetch in component body | Server Component `await` or custom hook |

---

## 7. Import Paths — always `@/` alias

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils/cn'
import { MAX_FILES } from '@/lib/constants/config'

// ❌ WRONG
import { Button } from '../../../components/ui/button'
```

---

## 8. Pre-submit Checklist — Design

- [ ] No arbitrary Tailwind values (`-[Xpx]`, `-[#hex]`)
- [ ] All colors and spacing reference tokens from `design-tokens.md`
- [ ] No duplicate tokens for the same design value
- [ ] All icons imported — not drawn with CSS or inlined as SVG
- [ ] Missing icons saved to `assets/icons/` as `.svg`
- [ ] Component placed in the correct folder (see §3)
- [ ] All screen states implemented — not just happy path
- [ ] Design source used as single source of truth
- [ ] Typography classes match element types (see §4 table)
- [ ] Props typed with `interface`, no `any`
- [ ] `cn()` used for all conditional classes
- [ ] `@/` alias used for every import
